    {
      "name": "Ignore browser boot failures",
      "description": "Stops a failed engine boot (MainLibraryBoot) from deadlocking the welcome screen. The Chromium engine ships inside the APK; if its load or start still fails (device without ARM support, a start error), Opera announces the failure to the welcome flow, which used to call the now-hidden \"broken installation\" dialog and then wait forever. The announcements are converted into success notifications so startup always continues. Pair with \"Spoof app signature\", which keeps Opera's in-app signature reads on their vendor-build behavior.",
      "default": true,
